<title>MALAYSIA: Nanyang Press year net down 41.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Nanyang Press year net down 41.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		15.81	vs	 27.0</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     25.9	 vs	 44.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		 267.80	vs	240.44</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  19.01	vs	 31.42</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less  0.15	vs   less 0.04</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  loss  0.52	vs   loss 3.73</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)    15.0	 vs	 15.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Nanyang Press (M) Bhd is a publisher.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
